      "rev_n_1_9acd5e_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_9acd5e_0",
        "node_id": "n_1_9acd5e",
        "thought_text": "Group names by their starting sequences and calculate permutations within each group. Then, multiply these permutations considering the order of groups as a whole.",
